    from your Deck with a different Type from the monsters you control.\r\n\u25CF
    Target face-up monsters your opponent controls, up to the number of \"tellarknight\"
    and \"Constellar\" monsters you control; negate their effects until the end of
    this turn.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Stellarnova Bonds\" per turn."
